SUMMARY:Minnesota: M3 due
DESCRIPTION:Minnesota partnership return due the 15th day of the 3rd month 
 after year-end. MN's PTE tax is reported on the same Form M3. Correction (t
 his rebuild session): the cited source states the general rule (15th day of
  the 3rd month) without addressing the 2026-specific weekend interaction - 
 March 15\, 2026 is a Sunday. Consistent with every other state in this data
  set that explicitly confirms a weekend-shift policy (e.g. Massachusetts\, 
 New York\, Vermont\, Delaware\, Montana\, Oregon all confirm shifting to Ma
 rch 16\, 2026)\, and with the near-universal US government-deadline convent
 ion of shifting to the next business day\, this entry's date_2026 was corre
 cted from an unshifted March 15\, 2026 to March 16\, 2026. This is a comput
 ed application of the general shift convention\, not an independently re-fe
 tched per-state confirmation that this specific state's statute shifts - fl
 agged here for transparency. | Minnesota partnership return due the 15th da
